#: ../../user_interface/monitors.rst:22
msgid "Monitors"
msgstr "Monitory"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors.rst:24
msgid ""
"Kdenlive uses two monitor :term:`widgets <widget>` to display and play back "
"your videos, images, titles, animations or audio files:"
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive používa dva monitorovacie :term:`widgety<widget>` na zobrazenie a "
"prehrávanie vašich videí, obrázkov, titulkov, animácií alebo audio súborov:"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors.rst:32
msgid ""
"The monitor widgets can be switched on or off by checking :menuselection:"
"`Menu --> View --> Clip Monitor` and :menuselection:`Project Monitor`, "
"respectively. Once activated, they can be selected by clicking the "
"corresponding tab which appears at the bottom of the monitor window."
msgstr ""
"Monitorovacie widgety môžete zapínať alebo vypínať zaškrtnutím :"
"menuselection:`Menu --> View --> Clip Monitor` a :menuselection:`Project "
"Monitor`. Po aktivácii ich môžete vybrať kliknutím na príslušnú záložku, "
"ktorá sa zobrazí v spodnej časti okna monitora."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors.rst:36
msgid ""
"Kdenlive supports an external monitor display using |bmd_decklink| cards."
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive podporuje zobrazenie na externom monitore pomocou kariet |"
"bmd_decklink|."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors.rst:38
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ui-monitors_clip_monitor` plays the :term:`clip` selected in the :"
"doc:`Project Bin </project_and_asset_management/project_bin>`. The :ref:`ui-"
"monitors_project_monitor` plays the timeline of the project starting at the "
"position of the :term:`playhead`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ui-monitors_clip_monitor` prehráva :term:`klip<clip>` vybraný v :doc:"
"`koši projektu </project_and_asset_management/project_bin>`. :ref:`ui-"
"monitors_project_monitor` prehráva časovú os projektu počínajúc pozíciou :"
"term:`prehrávacej hlavy<playhead>`."

