msgid ""
"Change overlay. Click through the different available patterns. You can :ref:"
"`change the color<ui-monitors_change_overlay_color>` of the patterns in :"
"menuselection:`Menu --> Settings --> Configure Kdenlive -->` :doc:`Colors "
"and Markers </getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_colors"
"+markers>`."
msgstr ""
"Zmeniť prekrytie. Prechádzajte rôznymi dostupnými vzormi. Farbu vzorov "
"môžete :ref:`zmeniť<ui-monitors_change_overlay_color>` v :menuselection:"
"`Menu --> Settings --> Configure Kdenlive -->` :doc:`Colors and Markers</"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_colors+markers>`."

